    "body": "## Problem\r\n\r\nre-editing a directory buffer... clears it?\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nrefresh the buffer instead via `BufReadCmd`\r\n\r\nlet this one slip through the cracks :/",
    "closed_at": "2026-06-30T18:19:54Z",
