            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "if this is to enable plugins, i think we might want `--clean` so that it doesn't pick up the user's local config when running tests locally?\n\n(suggestion is untested):\n```suggestion\n    n.clear({ args_rm = { '-u' }, args = { '--clean' } })\n```\n\nprobably we should use `--clean` by default in `testnvim.lua` , but that's a battle for another day",
